== Summaries ==
# BUSI speckle reduction: AI vs classical — results of this run

- Device: cpu (none); torch 2.15.0+cpu
- Images: 15 test / 10 val / 200 train, resized to 128x128, grayscale
- Noise: y = x·(1 + σ·n), n ~ N(0,1), σ ∈ [0.1, 0.2, 0.3]; identical noisy images for all methods
- Reference = original BUSI image (already contains native speckle). Mean ENL of the reference ROIs: 58.6

## Methods actually run

| method | category | training | train_time_s | params |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| DnCNN | AI - supervised, trained here | 200 clean BUSI imgs, synthetic speckle σ~U(0.05, 0.35), 1500 iters, 64x64 patches, batch 64 | 1996.100 | 556097 |
| Noise2Void | AI - self-supervised, trained here (no clean targets) | 600 noisy imgs (1 realisation per image per σ), 1500 iters, 2% blind-spot pixels | 573.900 | 1927841 |
| DRUNet | AI - pretrained (Gaussian), zero-shot, NOT trained here | deepinv drunet_deepinv_gray weights; verified (+8.46 dB on Gaussian check); log-domain; only σ_in chosen on val | 0.000 | 32638656 |
| DIP | AI - untrained (no dataset), optimised per image | no training; iterations/σ chosen on 2 val imgs: {0.1: 650, 0.2: 450, 0.3: 350} | 1062.900 | 1936769 |
| Median | classical filter | no training; params chosen on val: σ=0.1: {'size': 3}; σ=0.2: {'size': 3}; σ=0.3: {'size': 5} | 0.000 | 0 |
| Bilateral | classical filter | no training; params chosen on val: σ=0.1: {'sc': 0.2, 'ss': 1}; σ=0.2: {'sc': 0.6, 'ss': 1}; σ=0.3: {'sc': 0.6, 'ss': 2} | 0.000 | 0 |
| Lee | classical filter | no training; params chosen on val: σ=0.1: {'win': 3, 'cu': 0.1}; σ=0.2: {'win': 3, 'cu': 0.3}; σ=0.3: {'win': 3, 'cu': 0.5} | 0.000 | 0 |
| NLM | classical filter | no training; params chosen on val: σ=0.1: {'k': 1.5}; σ=0.2: {'k': 2.0}; σ=0.3: {'k': 2.0} | 0.000 | 0 |

